  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chobits-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fchobits-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"網站\"></a></p>\n<h1>概述</h1>\n<p>來自深受喜愛的動畫/漫畫《Chobits》。享受全面改版的 Minecraft 遊戲介面體驗，包含所有可愛的 Chobits，當然還有小奇的男友拓海。</p>\n<h1>預覽 - 更多請查看圖庫！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nLRvoV0h/images/b5cc8f3d8ddbb882a459ee96428dba69f236dd54.png\" alt=\"大型箱子選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nLRvoV0h/images/894d2a88800e43f8f594e09200f349ebc1fa8ef9.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nLRvoV0h/images/0ef9f0a344de38686e27b6b8a3703a7868cdde17.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 宣傳橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>資源包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 創作者或內容創作者並使用此資源包，請在描述中放置連結回本頁面，以便他人知道您使用的資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，這包括重新分發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
